AWS: provides reliable, scalable, on-demand cloud computing services

scalable: increase or decrease on requirement basis

on-demand: provide services based on the rent



IAAS: INFRASTRUCTURE AS A SERVICE

PAAS: PLATFORM AS A SERVICE

CAAS: CONTAINER AS A SERVICE

FAAS: FUNCTION AS A SERVICE

SAAS: SOFTWARE AS A SERVICE








Application : spring boot application

Data : like mysql, s3

Runtime : like jvm

Middleware : tomcat which sits between application and os(request routing, http handling, connection management)

OS : windows, linux

Virtulization : virtual server

RAM : In memory

CPU : Computing

storage : HDD, SDD

Networking : Router, switch, cables etc
